        "func": "// Only handle messages that came from RPC\nif (!msg.rpcResponseTopic) {\n    // Periodic polling: do nothing\n    return null;\n}\n\n// Use the built state as response\nconst state = msg.state || msg.payload;\n\nmsg.payload = state;\nmsg.topic = msg.rpcResponseTopic;\n\nreturn msg;\n",
